providers/reserved-default-service.toml is not a valid connector definition:
  - `[[services]]` declares "default" with `description`. "default" is reserved — it is the service an operation belongs to when it names none, and it is elided from every published address — so the entry may carry `roles`, `tags` and `audiences`, and nothing else. All three attach to a service and a single-surface provider has nowhere else to put them; everything else is already stated at connector level, and a second definition could disagree with it
